# ===========================================================================
# SMS — Root Environment Example (documentation pointer only)
#
# There is deliberately NO KEY=VALUE in this tracked file. The only
# application lives in app/, and its environment template is:
#
#     app/.env.example   <- copy to app/.env and fill in local values
#
# app/.env is gitignored. Never paste real credentials into any
# *.example file — example files ARE committed to Git.
#
# Where secrets live:
#   Local development ........ app/.env (DATABASE_URL, SESSION_SECRET,
#                              SEED_PASSWORD, EXPOSE_RESET_TOKENS,
#                              STAGING_DATABASE_URL)
#   Staging / production ..... `wrangler secret put <NAME> -e staging`
#                              or `-e production` (never in wrangler.toml)
#
# Cloudflare bindings (HYPERDRIVE, R2_BUCKET, NOTIFICATION_QUEUE) are
# configured in app/wrangler.toml, not in environment files.
# ===========================================================================
